# Offering CSV Import / Export

Bulk **Admin/DB** workflow for `v2_offering` (Session **template** layer). Not C-end UI. Web term: **Session card title** comes from `v2_offering.name`; this is not a Web navigation level — see `product-hierarchy.mdc`.

**Full operator spec:** [`scripts/design/offering-csv-import.md`](scripts/design/offering-csv-import.md)

**Status transitions** (UPDATE rows with `Status` change): [`offering-status-lifecycle.mdc`](offering-status-lifecycle.mdc) / [`scripts/design/offering-status-lifecycle.md`](scripts/design/offering-status-lifecycle.md)

## Scope

- **CLI only** — no Admin UI upload for offerings CSV.
- **Per offering type file** — one CSV per `v2_offering_type.code` (`camp`, `course`, `workshop`, …).
- **Schema-driven columns** — from `v2_offering_type.offering_schema.fields`; re-export after schema changes.
- **Runs locally** against Supabase via `.env.local` (`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`).

## Pipeline

```text
Export (DB → CSV + manifest)
  → Edit in Excel/Numbers (add rows: id empty; updates: keep id)
  → Import dry-run (validate, JSON report)
  → Import --execute (upsert v2_offering)
  → [later] import-instances.js (Session Title = offering.name + category)
```

Bootstrap (all active types): `node scripts/bootstrap-offering-csv.js`

