## Conventions for code changes

- Extend [`import-offerings-common.js`](scripts/lib/import-offerings-common.js); keep export/import CLIs thin.
- Match flatten/validate behavior in [`src/app/api/admin/offering/v2/route.ts`](src/app/api/admin/offering/v2/route.ts).
- Log prefix: `[v2_offering]` when adding server-side logs.
- Do not hardcode camp/course column maps — use `offering_schema`.
- Reports under `scripts/output/` (generally not committed).

## Catalog import order

1. **Offerings** (this pipeline) — posters via `Image Link`
2. **Instances** — [`instance-csv-import.md`](scripts/design/instance-csv-import.md); `Session Title` = `v2_offering.name` + matching category
